I just developed a way to get out of a shop with a pickaxe that seems fairly
safe:
----.|--
|..@...| <--- Manlobbi          
|%*(()(|
|*())[%|
|^^^^^^|
|.@.------You
--------

Cut a hole through the shop wall to get in (The shopkeeper won't let you
through the door with a pickaxe).  Then grab everything in the shop.  Then
dig a series of pits across the middle of the shop.  ONLY DIG ONCE - Don't
dig all the way through.  If you dig through, the shopkeeper will grab all
of your possessions as you fall.  Once you have the line of pits separating
you and the shopkeeper, dig one last one all the way through.  Asidonhopo
will run up to the line, but is too "smart" to jump into the pits to get to
you.  The alarm will sound, but you'll already be on the next level.
